Republishing edited photos writes their images: photo 1's thumbnail goes
where its figure shows it. Photo 2's figure was deleted, so its thumbnail
goes to the default path, and it gets a figure again, without a caption,
as when it was new.
-- request.json --
{
	"protocol": 5,
	"op": "publish",
	"service": [
		{
			"id": 10,
			"path": [
				"Recent"
			]
		}
	],
	"collection": 10,
	"photos": [
		{
			"uuid": "A1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
			"rendition": "$RENDER/1.jpg"
		},
		{
			"uuid": "B2000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
			"rendition": "$RENDER/2.jpg"
		}
	]
}
-- render/1.jpg --
full 1
-- render/2.jpg --
full 2 new
-- vault/Galleries/Recent.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 10
lightroom-path: Recent
---

[![](Galleries/Trip/a1.jpg)](vaultsite-fullsize:cat/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001)
Moved
-- vault/Galleries/Trip/a1.jpg --
thumb 1
-- vault/.vaultsite/fullsize/cat/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg --
full 1
-- vault/.vaultsite/fullsize/cat/b2/b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg --
full 2
-- vault/Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/b2/b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg --
thumb 2
-- want/response.json --
{
	"protocol": 5,
	"photos": [
		{
			"uuid": "A1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
			"remoteId": "a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg"
		},
		{
			"uuid": "B2000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
			"remoteId": "b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg"
		}
	]
}
-- want/log --
Recent: stored 2 of 2 photos
Galleries/Recent.md: added 1 figure
-- want/vault/.vaultsite/fullsize/cat/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg --
full 1
-- want/vault/.vaultsite/fullsize/cat/b2/b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg --
full 2 new
-- want/vault/Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/b2/b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg --
thumb of full 2 new
-- want/vault/Galleries/Recent.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 10
lightroom-path: Recent
---

